    "title": "Crime Stoppers: Burglary and Frandor retail fraud - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Shajaka Shelton ,\n1 hours ago\nLANSING, Mich. (WLNS) — This week on Crime Stoppers, law enforcement needs your help solving a burglary in Jackson and a retail fraud that happened at the Frandor Shopping Center.\nNicotine Theft (Crime Stoppers of Mid-Michigan) (Crime Stoppers of Mid-Michigan) (Crime Stoppers of Mid-Michigan) (Crime Stoppers of Mid-Michigan) (Crime Stoppers of Mid-Michigan) (Crime Stoppers of Mid-Michigan) The Michigan State Police are asking for any information that could identify two people involved in a burglary that happened in the early morning hours of May 9 at Avery Oil and Propane in Jackson. The two stole several nicotine products before leaving the area.",
